          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye omuruchi waAi, Yoswa yamweleesia khumusaala okhuula olwa bweela; mana eliuba niliyeela yabalaka, nabo nibaakula omulambokwe khumusaala tsana, nibakusukuna hamasanganjila keshilibwa shielitookho, nibakubunjikhakhwo lifuumi likhongo liamachina, eliliho okhuula olwa leelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
